@model AiModelInput
@{ ViewData["Title"] = Model.Id is null ? "新增模型接口" : "编辑模型接口"; }
<div class="page-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">MODEL CONFIGURATION</div><h1>@ViewData["Title"]<span class="heading-dot">.</span></h1><p>配置一个具体模型，供机器人自动回复使用。</p></div><a class="button secondary" asp-action="Index">返回接口列表</a></div>
<div class="form-grid"><section class="panel form-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><h2>接口配置</h2><p>填写完整接口地址，不会自动拼接路径</p></div></div><form asp-action="Edit" method="post" class="form-body" data-submit-lock><div asp-validation-summary="All" class="validation-summary" role="alert"></div><input asp-for="Id" type="hidden"/>
<div class="provider-presets"><span>填入接口示例</span><button class="button secondary compact" type="button" data-provider-preset="openai">OpenAI</button><button class="button secondary compact" type="button" data-provider-preset="deepseek">DeepSeek</button><button class="button secondary compact" type="button" data-provider-preset="zhipu">智谱</button></div>
<div class="field"><label asp-for="Name">展示名称 *</label><input asp-for="Name" maxlength="80" required placeholder="例如：我的主力模型"/></div><div class="field"><label asp-for="Provider">提供方 *</label><input asp-for="Provider" maxlength="80" required placeholder="OpenAI / DeepSeek / 智谱 / 自定义"/></div>
<div class="field"><label asp-for="ApiStyle">接口格式</label><select asp-for="ApiStyle"><option value="responses">OpenAI Responses API</option><option value="chat">兼容 Chat Completions API</option></select></div>
<div class="field"><label asp-for="Endpoint">完整 API 地址 *</label><input asp-for="Endpoint" type="url" maxlength="1024" required placeholder="https://api.example.com/v1/chat/completions"/><span class="field-help">可用自建兼容接口；不要在地址中放密钥或查询参数。建议使用 HTTPS。</span></div>
<div class="field"><label asp-for="ModelId">实际模型 ID *</label><input asp-for="ModelId" maxlength="256" required autocomplete="off" placeholder="按提供方 API 文档填写，区分大小写"/><span class="field-help">展示名称不等于模型 ID。请填写你的接口实际支持的值。</span></div>
<div class="field"><label asp-for="ApiKey">API Key <span class="optional">编辑时留空保留原密钥</span></label><div class="password-input"><input asp-for="ApiKey" type="password" value="" maxlength="4096" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="填写后加密保存，页面不回显"/><button type="button" class="icon-button toggle-password" aria-label="显示 API Key"><svg><use href="#i-eye"/></svg></button></div></div>
<div class="settings-two-columns"><div class="field"><label asp-for="TimeoutSeconds">单个模型超时（秒）</label><input asp-for="TimeoutSeconds" min="5" max="30" type="number" required/></div><div class="field"><label asp-for="MaxOutputTokens">最大输出 Token</label><input asp-for="MaxOutputTokens" min="64" max="4096" type="number" required/></div></div>
<label class="switch-row"><span><strong>启用模型接口</strong><small>需先填写 API Key；停用后自动回退到下一模型</small></span><span class="switch"><input asp-for="Enabled"/><span></span></span></label><div class="form-actions"><a class="button secondary" asp-action="Index">取消</a><button class="button primary" type="submit">保存模型接口</button></div></form></section>
<aside class="form-aside"><div class="guide-icon"><svg><use href="#i-bot"/></svg></div><h2>按顺序，稳定回复</h2><p>为 OpenAI、DeepSeek、智谱等具体模型分别创建接口，再在机器人中排序。前一个接口超时、报错或没有有效文本时，尝试下一个。</p><div class="aside-tip"><svg><use href="#i-info"/></svg><p>自动回复每次最多等待 60 秒，最终向原会话发送一条消息。全部模型不可用时保留失败记录，不重复发送。</p></div><div class="aside-tip"><svg><use href="#i-shield"/></svg><p>启用机器人 AI 自动回复后，收到的消息文本会发送到你选定的模型接口。此页保存操作不会调用模型。</p></div></aside></div>
